    {
      "id": "28b59f7a-c7a8-46d6-ba7c-fc1c64ac82ed",
      "title": "Escute a frase e observe a forma do verbo com yo.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "6ad2c65f-59d3-436b-96e2-72eea1bf1a7b",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora volte a uma cena da casa.</p><p><strong>Yo pongo la mesa.</strong></p><p>Em português: Eu arrumo a mesa para a refeição.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/53b4adc2c6714ec081cfb3aa8a08721f_b05-yo-pongo-la-mesa.mp3?Expires=1794099499&Signature=AREfP5j8De4Xud4~h0hZ6Ak0VdJFUrAEyutpQXe3jevs7MqSIKdMmOWyqGpOZZNTH~yC-bhfPIW5PuS~cWxcI6kV5A3tiH9bfsqVPMkSf-yr0YXZPf7PrP67PmATM0bTBOtMnxYwJ63cVTIJZ8Evz83oBYUQZXbIbI~OEPEc6RqcC2Kq9DQqhYZRR9uhhbXW99nIMMT6bLWRxlxOqAx8Er-ph-54IgfKudwTy0DbgSCGqZCrbBlt-sKDEYqxv1J04Kuiofu3bGTLJACV8BS79pXsJRndtkWjuRA9j6w3IsxbC6KnsfmExCYpXDvD77VIblOXD4s7VQLXdfBlgTvl7Q__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
